        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "3a64f4d1-f9f1-57b5-86c1-cc538e44057b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tessa Thompson, Phylicia Rashād, Tony Bellew, Graham McTavish\n- Films: Creed, Rocky, Rocky II, Rocky III, Rocky IV, Rocky V, Rocky Balboa\n- Film series: Rocky film series\n- Sports titles: British light-heavyweight title, Commonwealth light-heavyweight title, European cruiserweight title, WBC cruiserweight title\n\nFacts:\n- The Rocky film series was released in this order: Rocky (1976), Rocky II (1979), Rocky III (1982), Rocky IV (1985), Rocky V (1990), Rocky Balboa (2006), and Creed (2015).\n- Tony Bellew held the British and Commonwealth light-heavyweight titles between 2010 and 2014.\n- Creed also features Tessa Thompson, Phylicia Rashād, Tony Bellew, and Graham McTavish.\n- Tony Bellew held the European cruiserweight title from 2015 to 2016.\n- Tony Bellew held the WBC cruiserweight title from 2016 to 2017.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "ba07c309-539f-59a0-a665-ddeabcdc92cd",
        "text": "Page: Creed (film). Sentence: It also features Tessa Thompson, Phylicia Rashād, Tony Bellew and Graham McTavish.\nPage: Tony Bellew. Sentence: He held the WBC cruiserweight title from 2016 to 2017, and previously the British and Commonwealth light-heavyweight titles between 2010 and 2014, and the European cruiserweight title from 2015 to 2016.\nPage: Rocky (film series). Sentence: The films by order of release date are: \"Rocky\" (1976), \"Rocky II\" (1979), \"Rocky III\" (1982), \"Rocky IV\" (1985), \"Rocky V\" (1990), \"Rocky Balboa\" (2006) and \"Creed\" (2015).",
